1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:01,120
Meera: Close your eyes.

2
00:00:01,940 --> 00:00:03,500
Arjun: Okay... closed.

3
00:00:04,380 --> 00:00:05,280
Meera: Which side is red?

4
00:00:06,460 --> 00:00:07,160
Arjun: No idea!

5
00:00:08,039 --> 00:00:11,040
Meera: Feel it. The rings... are red.

6
00:00:11,960 --> 00:00:13,710
Arjun: Wait... dots are blue.

7
00:00:13,710 --> 00:00:15,620
Arjun: And this dome... yellow!

8
00:00:16,580 --> 00:00:18,600
Meera: Every colour has its own texture.

9
00:00:19,540 --> 00:00:22,615
Arjun: So blind and low-vision kids can solve it by touch...

10
00:00:22,615 --> 00:00:24,820
Arjun: and I can play it with the lights off.

11
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:26,997
Meera: LVC Dream Cube.

12
